$Descr A4 11693 8268
Sheet 1 1
Title "Cluster Logic Board"
Date "2026-08-07"
Rev "B"
Comp "Derek Eyes-in-Cans Cluster Controller"
Comment1 "ESP32-S3, dual DFPlayer Mini, OLED, PIRs, ID DIP, JST interconnect"
Comment2 "Separate 5V input; no servo power on this board"
$EndDescr
